   "Area 5 rule: one course from 5A and one from 5B; at least one of the two must be associated with a laboratory. 5C: LABORATORY (Total 0, 'Complete the following number of rules: 0') is a reference list of lab-associated courses repeating 5A and 5B and is not recorded as a separate block.",
