   "Catalog prints GEOG001 at 4 units (state file 3) and PHYSICS002B at 4 units (state file 3); printed units used.",
   "Catalog codes written without spaces (e.g., ENGLC1000, BUS039) are treated as matching closed-list codes (ENGL C1000, BUS 39).",
